abstract: >
  Reproducible workflows, methodological documentation, and derived spatial
  data supporting analyses of hydroclimatic change, climate extremes,
  atmospheric blocking, land-use and land-cover change, and land-surface
  temperature across the Brazilian Legal Amazon.

